        "RISK: the dW GEMM uses transposed-strided reads (model_stage_decoder_tc.cuh:604-606, 'ring blocker (b), needs TMA-with-transpose; out of scope') — TMA-with-transpose is harder; scope the first CuTe rewrite to the fwd/dX K-major GEMMs (DecGmemTileSrcA/B flat row-major K-contiguous sources, model_stage_decoder_tc.cuh:610-633) and keep the synchronous/scalar staging for dW initially."
      ],
